v2.9.6
Improved Setup Factory / VISE / Gentee handling.
Improved EXE extraction pipeline.
PEiD fallback is now deferred instead of running too early.
Removed generic CheckExt() from the EXE flow.
Fixed several incorrect $TYPE_* mappings.
NSIS and RAR SFX now use the generic 7-Zip path.
Improved TrID fallback with multiple matches.
Cleaner unsupported EXE status/logging.
Overall: safer routing and fewer false positives.